    "Both signal at m0 and execute at m1 in token order (tokA first).",
    "tokA: 120 x 0.50 = 60 -> cash 40.",
    "tokB: equity 100 (40 cash + 60 marked), cash allows floor(40 / 0.50) = 80 shares < 120; binding constraint cash",
    "(exposure headroom 100 - 60 = 40 also allows 80 but is not tighter). 80 < minimum 100 -> REJECTED_MIN_SIZE.",
    "tokB's entry condition still holds at m2, so the same signal episode retries (attempt 2), due at m3, which is past the data: pending at end.",
    "One episode for tokB -> one REJECTED_MIN_SIZE row with attempts = 2; signals generated = 2 (tokA, tokB).",
    "End: tokA valued at mark 0.50 -> cash 40 + 60 = 100."
